  first | exact @GlobalTheory.FinWeil.WdCocycle.wd_cocycle | exact GlobalTheory.FinWeil.WdCocycle.wd_cocycle | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.FinWeil.WdCocycle.wd_cocycle <;> assumption)
